│ -  I have updated to the lastest minor and patch version of Strands                                                                             │
│ -  I have checked the documentation and this is not expected behavior                                                                           │
│ -  I have searched [./issues](./issues?q=) and there are no duplicates of my issue                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Strands Version                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1.2.0                                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Python Version                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 3.12.0                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Operating System                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ macOS 15.5                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Installation Method                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ pip                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1. Set region in ~/.aws/config (other than US regions)                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ output = json                                                                                                                                   │
│ region = ap-northeast-1                                                                                                                         │
│ credential_process = REDACTED                                                                                                                   │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 2. Run (https://strandsagents.com/latest/documentation/docs/user-guide/quickstart/#project-setup) (which defaults to                            │
│ us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0 model) `uv run main.py` -> fails (as expected, because it tries to call US model from apac session)  │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│ botocore.errorfactory.ValidationException: An error occurred (ValidationException) when calling the ConverseStream operation: The provided      │
│ model identifier is invalid.                                                                                                                    │
│ └ Bedrock region: ap-northeast-1                                                                                                                │
│ └ Model id: us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0                                                                                          │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│ 3. Run it with region override `AWS_REGION=us-west-2 uv run main.py`                                                                            │
│ ### Expected Behavior                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Step 3 successes by calling us CRI model with us-west-2 session.                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Actual Behavior                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Step 3 fails. It seems we cannot override the region from environment variable.                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Additional Context                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The current workaround seems using `AWS_DEFAULT_REGION` environment variable instead. e.g. `AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-west-2 uv run main.py`        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Possible Solution                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ I think the expected behavior is that AWS_REGION environment variable is always prioritized first here.                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ https://github.com/strands-agents/sdk-python/blob/3d526f2e254d38bb83b8ec85af56e79e4e1fe33f/src/strands/models/bedrock.py#L138                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
